{
  "$comment": "A validation target: an external DPP model at one version, hosted as GITB validation types by OpenEPCIS DPP-Ready. UNTP 0.7.0: the release whose public review closed in July 2026; OpenEPCIS's bridge context extensions/common/interop/context/untp-0.7.0-context.jsonld follows it. Artifacts are checked against the vendor MANIFEST.json on every build; pnpm run sync:untp -- --latest adds a newer version as a target of its own.",
